#: ../../../user/templates/windows/qubes-windows-tools.rst:210
#: e6fbfe4efb6840ca8acc487f51cbb494
msgid ""
"Installing the Qubes Windows Tools on Windows 7, 10, and 11, both as a "
"StandaloneVM as well as a Template VM and a corresponding AppVM, is "
